		{
			"id": "Go2xBVYx",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 32,
			"y": 922,
			"width": 472.24954095725815,
			"height": 100.57772459062585,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aK",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 405454572,
			"version": 140,
			"versionNonce": 607240536,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778900853509,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Congestion (RAP, IVC, TR):  PVPI >0.5 = 81% Sn / 87% Sp for congestion-driven\nTBili\n  -> Rx: Aggressive diuresis; ultrafiltration if diuretic-resistant\nHypoperfusion (CI <2.2, shock) — 2-hit required (congestion + hypoperfusion):\n  -> ALT:LDH <1.5 = ischemic hepatitis (ACLI). Peak d1-3; normalize d5-10 if hemo\nimproves\n  -> Rx: Inotropes, MCS escalation (Impella, VA-ECMO, IABP)",
			"fontSize": 11.494597096071526,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Congestion (RAP, IVC, TR):  PVPI >0.5 = 81% Sn / 87% Sp for congestion-driven TBili\n  -> Rx: Aggressive diuresis; ultrafiltration if diuretic-resistant\nHypoperfusion (CI <2.2, shock) — 2-hit required (congestion + hypoperfusion):\n  -> ALT:LDH <1.5 = ischemic hepatitis (ACLI). Peak d1-3; normalize d5-10 if hemo improves\n  -> Rx: Inotropes, MCS escalation (Impella, VA-ECMO, IABP)",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "Congestion (RAP, IVC, TR):  PVPI >0.5 = 81% Sn / 87% Sp for congestion-driven TBili\n  -> Rx: Aggressive diuresis; ultrafiltration if diuretic-resistant\nHypoperfusion (CI <2.2, shock) — 2-hit required (congestion + hypoperfusion):\n  -> ALT:LDH <1.5 = ischemic hepatitis (ACLI). Peak d1-3; normalize d5-10 if hemo improves\n  -> Rx: Inotropes, MCS escalation (Impella, VA-ECMO, IABP)"
		},
