		{
			"id": "s2_hep_b",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 650,
			"y": 562,
			"width": 479.4033203125,
			"height": 259.9593158700379,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aR",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 675829332,
			"version": 76,
			"versionNonce": 1565323816,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778901434027,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "RUQ Ultrasound:\n- Dilated ducts -> Extrahepatic\n  (stones/malignancy)\n  -> MRCP or ERCP\n- No dilation -> Intrahepatic\n\nIntrahepatic differential:\n- Congestive hepatopathy (MOST COMMON in HF-ICU) Correlates with TR/RAP\n- Drug-induced: amiodarone,\n  antibiotics, TPN\n- Infiltrative: amyloidosis,\n  sarcoidosis, hepatic mets\n- PBC: check AMA, ANA\n- PSC: check pANCA\n- Sepsis-assoc cholestasis\n\nRx: Decongestion if cardiac",
			"fontSize": 12.233379570354726,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "RUQ Ultrasound:\n- Dilated ducts -> Extrahepatic\n  (stones/malignancy)\n  -> MRCP or ERCP\n- No dilation -> Intrahepatic\n\nIntrahepatic differential:\n- Congestive hepatopathy (MOST COMMON in HF-ICU) Correlates with TR/RAP\n- Drug-induced: amiodarone,\n  antibiotics, TPN\n- Infiltrative: amyloidosis,\n  sarcoidosis, hepatic mets\n- PBC: check AMA, ANA\n- PSC: check pANCA\n- Sepsis-assoc cholestasis\n\nRx: Decongestion if cardiac",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "RUQ Ultrasound:\n- Dilated ducts -> Extrahepatic\n  (stones/malignancy)\n  -> MRCP or ERCP\n- No dilation -> Intrahepatic\n\nIntrahepatic differential:\n- Congestive hepatopathy (MOST COMMON in HF-ICU) Correlates with TR/RAP\n- Drug-induced: amiodarone,\n  antibiotics, TPN\n- Infiltrative: amyloidosis,\n  sarcoidosis, hepatic mets\n- PBC: check AMA, ANA\n- PSC: check pANCA\n- Sepsis-assoc cholestasis\n\nRx: Decongestion if cardiac"
		},
