			"updated": 1778901136679,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Broader DDx:\n- DILI\n- Viral hepatitis ALT:LDH\n>1.5\n- Autoimmune hepatitis\n- Ischemic with partial\nrecovery\n- Sepsis\n\nWorkup:\n- ALT:LDH ratio\n- Hepatitis panel\n- ANA, ASMA\n- Med review",
